   "opacity": 100,
   "originalText": "HomeGym database (backend/db/migrations/000001_init_schema.up.sql)\n\nPK primary key · FK foreign key → table · PF both · type? = nullable\nArrow from the referencing table to the referenced one; dashed = nullable FK\nEvery table with a user_id belongs to one user (FK → users, not drawn)\ncreated_at / updated_at / deleted_at left out; 'soft delete' = has deleted_at\n\nYellow account · Grey shared lookups · Green exercise library\nPurple cycles · Blue planning (trainings, sessions, blocks) · Orange tracking\nGenerated with the schema-diagram skill; don't edit by hand",
   "roughness": 0,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1001,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "text": "HomeGym database (backend/db/migrations/000001_init_schema.up.sql)\n\nPK primary key · FK foreign key → table · PF both · type? = nullable\nArrow from the referencing table to the referenced one; dashed = nullable FK\nEvery table with a user_id belongs to one user (FK → users, not drawn)\ncreated_at / updated_at / deleted_at left out; 'soft delete' = has deleted_at\n\nYellow account · Grey shared lookups · Green exercise library\nPurple cycles · Blue planning (trainings, sessions, blocks) · Orange tracking\nGenerated with the schema-diagram skill; don't edit by hand",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "type": "text",
   "updated": 1,
